le value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs 75 years, and February to March came in under 90% of normal in 36 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025, August to September ran 58% of normal, while April to May ran 156%. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 46% of normal on the middle of the grids. On grid 22985 the driest year was 1999 at 59%.</p>"}
